            ("Are the Rebuild films a remake?", "They start as one. 1.0 retells episodes 1 to 6 closely, 2.0 starts from the same place and pulls away, and 3.0 and 3.0+1.0 tell a new story. Some details in the final film hint at a link to the original continuity, which fans still debate, but you can treat Rebuild as a separate retelling."),
