            ("Are the Demon Slayer compilation films worth watching?", "Only if you want to see an episode in a cinema. To the Swordsmith Village (2023) and To the Hashira Training (2024) each joined the end of one arc to the first episode of the next for a theatrical run, and every one of those episodes is in the TV series."),
            ("When is Infinity Castle Part 2 coming out?", "There is no date. ufotable's 2026 announcement listed it as a future project rather than a 2026 release, so 2027 is the earliest realistic year. Part 3 will follow it."),
            ("Where should I start the manga after the anime?", "Chapter 140 is where the Infinity Castle arc begins, if you want the whole finale on the page. To skip what Part 1 covered, start around chapter 157, after the fight with Akaza. The manga ends at chapter 205."),
            ("Can I skip any arc?", "Not really. Swordsmith Village and Hashira Training are the weakest arcs, but both introduce Hashira and abilities the finale depends on, and Hashira Training is only eight episodes. There are no filler episodes."),
